You questioned whether gemini-2.5-flash was available for your vision processing step.	Clarified model string options across Gemini versions (gemini-2.5-flash, gemini-2.0-flash, gemini-1.5-flash) and offered Groq-native vision models as an alternative.	
Configuration:


python\n# Gemini 2.5 Flash setup\nresponse = gemini_client.models.generate_content(\n model="gemini-2.5-flash",\n contents=[...]\n)\n

