Deprecated Model Usage


"dont use llama-3.3-70b-versatile i have already told you its decomminisioned"

You specified that llama-3.3-70b-versatile was decommissioned on the Groq endpoint and requested switching specifically to openai/gpt-oss-120b.	Updated the final text-estimation step in Agent 3 (_generate_final_estimate) to use openai/gpt-oss-120b.	
Before:


python\nmodel="llama-3.3-70b-versatile"\n


After:


